0..80 Comment "//! Addition on the naturals in the spellings an arm admits, each as the sugared"
81..159 Comment "//! form writes it: a `run` that only sequences the recursive call, its result"
160..235 Comment "//! returned or the `return` elided, is written with the call nested in the"
236..312 Comment "//! constructor it returns (the base\'s `plus`), and a `run` written inside a"
313..383 Comment "//! constructor\'s field stays. Each spelling runs to the same value. A"
384..462 Comment "//! structural recursive call stands one stage below the term it was read from"
463..532 Comment "//! [Abel-2004-termination_checking_with_types]. The lists\' folds are"
533..593 Comment "//! `recursive-lists.gandr` and `recursive-nat-lists.gandr`."
594..597 Comment "//!"
598..654 Comment "//! - cites: [Abel-2004-termination_checking_with_types]"
655..658 Comment "//!"
